# Every node of an included file is named through the SITE that includes
# the file, never by the file's own path, and that holds for the verbs
# that take a node as well as the ones that print one.
#
#   src -> gate (an @include) -> out   the file parks on a timer
#   gate.key                           an access node, nothing runs it
#
# `weft wake <color> gate.hold` resolves the timer, `weft connect --node
# gate.key` picks its connection, and `@src:lib:gate.hold` is refused.

src = Text { value: "hello" }

gate = @include("lib/gate.weft")
gate.text = src.value

out = Debug
out.data = gate.out
